= Karl Jarres

Karl Jarres is a prominent lawyer and our candidate for president in 1925.

- @defend_taming
- @police_affairs
- @snap_election
- @root: Return to main

@defend_taming
title: Defend the "taming strategy"
subtitle: The <span style="color: #954B00;">**nazis**</span> must be brought into government.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; nationalist_strength += 5; nsdap_relation += 4*(1-dissent); liberal_dissent += 5; dvp_right += 1

Mainly proposed by General Kurt von Schleicher, we beleive the <span style="color: #954B00;">**NSDAP**</span> can be transformed into a constructive force to purge Germany of Marxism.


@police_affairs
title: Police affairs 
subtitle: We can set our police policy. 
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and dvp_in_government and interior_minister_party == dvp_name
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not dvp_in_government: The <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> is not in government. ?][? if interior_minister_party != dvp_name: The <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> does not have the Interior ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; police_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: police


@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if president != "Jarres" : Jarres must be Chancellor or President. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and (president == "Jarres")
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; time_to_election = 3
call: set_next_election_time

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].
